        <slide>
            <title>
                Objectives:
            </title>
                <ul>
                    <li>
                        <p>
                            Explain Least squares coefficient estimates for linear
                            regression
                        </p>
                    </li>
    
                    <li>
                        <p>
                            Define esidual sum of squares (RSS)
                        </p>
                    </li>
                </ul>

